# Milestone 15 - Shared Product Family Models

## Objective

Promote product-family assignment logic into shared reusable marts models.

This phase creates:
- `marts.product_family_map`
- `marts.dim_product_families`

The goal is to stop repeating complex family-derivation logic across multiple downstream analysis views and instead establish a reusable source of truth for product-family assignment.

---

## Why this work was done now

Product-family logic began as downstream analysis logic, but it has now become a recurring semantic dependency across the project.

By this point in the project, product-family logic is already central to:
- product-family performance analysis
- monthly family revenue trends
- recent family trend classification
- planned customer x product-family mix analysis

Because the same family assignment and canonical naming logic was being repeated in multiple places, this became a good moment to move that logic upstream into shared modeled objects.

---

## Deliverables

### Shared marts models
- `sql/marts/product_family_map.sql`
- `sql/marts/dim_product_families.sql`

### Validation
- `sql/validation/product_family_models_validation.sql`

